    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=612 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b3fbc537e2c3120a0f5fc47130ef3452.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=614 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b3fbc537e2c3120a0f5fc47130ef3452.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b3fbc537e2c3120a0f5fc47130ef3452.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, scavenge, craft and survive against relentless zombies and dangerous players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Midnight Walkers</i> is a <strong>hardcore PvE / PvPvE first-person zombie survival extraction shooter</strong>. <br>Survivors must explore <strong>Liberty Grand Center</strong> mega complex, scavenging for gear while fighting deadly zombies.  <br>Craft weapons, armor, and consumables, or trade items with other players through the <strong>dark web-based marketplace</strong> to secure even stronger equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played in <strong>solo or trios mode</strong>, while you explore various floors such as shopping malls, hospitals, and casinos\u2014each with its own challenges.  <br>Plan your survival and escape routes carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully escaping will allow you to store the gear and items you\u2019ve secured in your <strong>personal stash</strong> or use them in your next run.<br>However, if you fall to zombies, rival survivors, or the deadly <strong>poison gas</strong>, <strong>you\u2019ll lose everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/916ea192ae2dc82386d9e8017f081172.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=614 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/916ea192ae2dc82386d9e8017f081172.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/916ea192ae2dc82386d9e8017f081172.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b0100be8b8fc2311bea85449b138442a.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b0100be8b8fc2311bea85449b138442a.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b0100be8b8fc2311bea85449b138442a.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a mega-complex overrun by extremely dangerous zombies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberty Grand Center mega-complex is overrun by dangerous zombies, mutated variants, deadly bosses, and desperate survivors using any means necessary to scavenge for the same loot as you. <strong>Utilize elevators</strong> to explore shopping mall, hospital, and casino floors, and plan escape route from dangers, including the <strong>countdown-triggered poison gas system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the gas spreads across random floors every few minutes, survivors must stay alert and move swiftly. <br>Continuous exposure to this <strong>fatal gas dramatically reduces survival chances to 0.</strong> Put your combat survival skills to the test see how long you can last in the unforgiving and lethal Liberty Grand Center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/a3af995b3482ede3f003c107700e14f2.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=614 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/a3af995b3482ede3f003c107700e14f2.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/a3af995b3482ede3f003c107700e14f2.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/285891d8d0bd4a2320c4e52ab1ceed4c.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/285891d8d0bd4a2320c4e52ab1ceed4c.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/285891d8d0bd4a2320c4e52ab1ceed4c.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up with your custom slayer's arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm yourself with a diverse range of melee weapons and firearms.</strong> The Dagger and Katana deliver rapid strikes, much like the revolver. For hard hitting power, the Sledgehammer and break-action single-barrel Shotgun deliver devastating results. The bow and bolt-action rifle offer long-range precision, rewarding skilled shots with deadly takedowns. Strategically wield them to outmatch both the <strong>zombies and rival survivors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/62aa7dbfffe8958c923120e9f0370d96.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=614 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/62aa7dbfffe8958c923120e9f0370d96.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/62aa7dbfffe8958c923120e9f0370d96.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/155c93c5cbeb63c761bfce7c1bb5f24f.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/155c93c5cbeb63c761bfce7c1bb5f24f.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/155c93c5cbeb63c761bfce7c1bb5f24f.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter deadly zombies, mutated variants, and lethal bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies in Liberty Grand Center are deadly, with their threat escalating as their numbers grow. Slow-moving Walkers and Crawlers are easy to avoid but can quickly overwhelm if you\u2019re not careful. Runners, on the other hand, are quick to ambush inattentive survivors, easily attracted to noise and adding to the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated zombie variants are powerful threats with <strong>dangerous abilities that demand immediate attention.</strong> Acid-spitters force survivors to stay mobile, pushing them to close the gap to engage. Smashers, with their massive health, slam the ground to create AOE shockwaves. Meanwhile, Rammers rush toward survivors like a battering ram, aiming to scatter the group and cause chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each enemy demands a unique approach</strong>, and taking on multiple zombies at once requires both strategy and skill- especially if, against all odds, you find yourself facing them all at once. <strong>Surviving means knowing when to fight, or when to run.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=612 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b3fbc537e2c3120a0f5fc47130ef3452.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=614 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b3fbc537e2c3120a0f5fc47130ef3452.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b3fbc537e2c3120a0f5fc47130ef3452.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, scavenge, craft and survive against relentless zombies and dangerous players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Midnight Walkers</i> is a <strong>hardcore PvE / PvPvE first-person zombie survival extraction shooter</strong>. <br>Survivors must explore <strong>Liberty Grand Center</strong> mega complex, scavenging for gear while fighting deadly zombies.  <br>Craft weapons, armor, and consumables, or trade items with other players through the <strong>dark web-based marketplace</strong> to secure even stronger equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played in <strong>solo or trios mode</strong>, while you explore various floors such as shopping malls, hospitals, and casinos\u2014each with its own challenges.  <br>Plan your survival and escape routes carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully escaping will allow you to store the gear and items you\u2019ve secured in your <strong>personal stash</strong> or use them in your next run.<br>However, if you fall to zombies, rival survivors, or the deadly <strong>poison gas</strong>, <strong>you\u2019ll lose everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/916ea192ae2dc82386d9e8017f081172.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=614 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/916ea192ae2dc82386d9e8017f081172.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/916ea192ae2dc82386d9e8017f081172.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b0100be8b8fc2311bea85449b138442a.poster.avif?t=1755180122\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b0100be8b8fc2311bea85449b138442a.webm?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/b0100be8b8fc2311bea85449b138442a.mp4?t=1755180122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a mega-complex overrun by extremely dangerous zombies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberty Grand Center mega-complex is overrun by dangerous zombies,