p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies in Liberty Grand Center are deadly, with their threat escalating as their numbers grow. Slow-moving Walkers and Crawlers are easy to avoid but can quickly overwhelm if you\u2019re not careful. Runners, on the other hand, are quick to ambush inattentive survivors, easily attracted to noise and adding to the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated zombie variants are powerful threats with <strong>dangerous abilities that demand immediate attention.</strong> Acid-spitters force survivors to stay mobile, pushing them to close the gap to engage. Smashers, with their massive health, slam the ground to create AOE shockwaves. Meanwhile, Rammers rush toward survivors like a battering ram, aiming to scatter the group and cause chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each enemy demands a unique approach</strong>, and taking on multiple zombies at once requires both strategy and skill- especially if, against all odds, you find yourself facing them all at once. <strong>Surviving means knowing when to fight, or when to run.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Fight, scavenge, and extract in The Midnight Walkers, a hardcore FPS game with deadly zombies, dangerous players, and valuable loot. Craft weapons, armor, and consumables; trade items; and maintain your hideout. Escape Liberty Grand Center mega complex, and thrive...or die and lose everything.",
